# Magefan_Blog
FEATURED_APIS_906=lvl1_rest__create_blog_post::post::/V1/blog/post
FEATURED_APIS_906_DESCRIPTION=Create a blog post via Magefan_Blog. Magefan module has this strage behaivour - post is saved without the content on creation and should be updated with content after.
FEATURED_APIS_907=lvl1_rest__update_blog_post::put::/V1/blog/post/{id}
FEATURED_APIS_907_DESCRIPTION=Update a blog post via Magefan_Blog. Partial updates (passing only the updated fileds) are supported!
FEATURED_APIS_908=lvl1_rest__delete_blog_post::delete::/V1/blog/post/{id}
FEATURED_APIS_908_DESCRIPTION=Delete a blog post via Magefan_Blog
FEATURED_APIS_909=lvl1_rest__get_blog_post::get::/V1/blog/post/{id}
FEATURED_APIS_909_DESCRIPTION=Get a blog post via Magefan_Blog
FEATURED_APIS_9010=lvl1_rest__get_blog_post_list::get::/V1/blog/post/list/{type}/{term}/{store_id}/{page}/{limit}
FEATURED_APIS_9010_DESCRIPTION=Get a list of blog posts via Magefan_Blog